<title>HONG KONG: Zhenhai Refining 1996 net rises 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Zhenhai Refining 1996 net rises 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		   0.25     vs 0.22</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	    0.05     vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    592.42   vs 521.84</p>
<p>    Turnover		     8,800.85 vs 6,577.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Zhenhai Refining &amp; Chemical Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  May 21 to June 20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Zhenhai Refining is a producer of petroleum products, intermediate petrochemicals and fertilisers.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 0.07 yuen (including interim dividend of 0.02 yuan) vs 0.06 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
